WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.052
The durable takeaway is simple.

2
00:00:02.052 --> 00:00:04.237
C V identifies the CORE-V family.

3
00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:09.003
In CVA6, A means application class and six names the six-stage pipeline.

4
00:00:09.003 --> 00:00:14.828
CVA6 itself is a configurable repository and project, not one immutable production core.

5
00:00:14.828 --> 00:00:24.361
Historical naming diagrams can explain how labels such as C V thirty two E four zero P were formed, but current manuals decide present behavior.

6
00:00:24.361 --> 00:00:31.775
Read the name for orientation, then read the configuration and release evidence before making a technical claim.

